00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:06.400
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a Canadian comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:15.920
called “No Men Beyond This point.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.520
At the beginning of the movie, we are&nbsp;
introduced to a thirty-seven years old man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:27.840
named Andrew Myers. He happens to be the&nbsp;
youngest man on earth. Father Ermanno Bassi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.680
is also one of the few men alive. He tells us how&nbsp;
the extinction of the male species first started.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:38.880
The father has been a priest ever since he was&nbsp;
a teenager and was familiar with the concept of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:44.800
a virgin birth when it all started. Before the&nbsp;
crisis, every year about three or four women&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:50.160
claimed to have gotten pregnant without sexual&nbsp;
intercourse. It was regarded as a miraculous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:55.520
and one timely event by the church, even though&nbsp;
scientists didn’t agree with it. But everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.520 --> 00:01:02.480
changed in 1953 when in a single year, sixty-seven&nbsp;
women came forward claiming that they got pregnant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:07.840
even though they were virgins. At the time it&nbsp;
first began, many people followed Christianity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:13.280
which validated virgin births as miracles. Science&nbsp;
couldn’t prove if the claims were untrue because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:18.640
there were no DNA testing methods then. The people&nbsp;
only had access to blood tests that proved if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:24.000
someone is not the father, and there was no way&nbsp;
to confirm if the child had a father at all.
&nbsp;

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.600
When it all first started people believed that&nbsp;
by nature, a baby can only be born when a sperm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:34.800
fertilizes the egg. So, even though many women&nbsp;
were coming out with their stories, the only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:40.160
logical conclusion seemed to be that they were&nbsp;
all lying. One of the first women who experienced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:45.680
fatherless pregnancy was Helen Duval. She is&nbsp;
currently over sixty years old and is finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:52.160
sharing her story. In 1953, Helen was a young&nbsp;
married woman when she got pregnant. Back then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:57.040
there were no pregnancy tests so she was in utter&nbsp;
shock when the doctor announced her pregnancy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:01.760
because she and her husband hadn’t had sexual&nbsp;
intercourse in over a year. The couple went for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:05.920
a second appointment to see if the results were&nbsp;
incorrect but the results came out positive the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:10.960
second time as well. Helen’s husband left her&nbsp;
because he thought she cheated. She doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:15.680
blame him as anyone logical would have thought&nbsp;
the same. There was no other explanation for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:21.120
situation she was in. Over the years she told her&nbsp;
story to a lot of people but the harder she tried&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:26.800
to convince people she was telling the truth,&nbsp;
the crazier she sounded. Eventually, she, too,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:32.880
started to believe that she was crazy. It&nbsp;
wasn’t until 1988 when a DNA test was developed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:39.120
that people finally believed her truth.
A TV interview from 1945 shows us a man talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:44.080
about fatherless birth claims. He says that the&nbsp;
thousands of women from around the world coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:50.320
forth with such claims are all lying. According&nbsp;
to him, women are prone to hysteria by nature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:54.800
which means that they are copying each&nbsp;
other to create this trend of false births&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:59.680
to hide their mischievousness. Even when&nbsp;
the trend began to grow to a larger scale,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:04.560
the world leaders, who were all men at that time,&nbsp;
ignored it. Mostly because they couldn’t handle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:09.840
the fact that they weren’t needed for procreation&nbsp;
anymore. As time went by, the more women came&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:15.440
forth with fatherless pregnancies, the more men&nbsp;
disregarded their claims. Because of this, women&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:20.240
began to harbor anger towards men that was soon&nbsp;
going to change the course of human history. 
&nbsp;

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:26.240
Then, sister Isabella came along. She was a&nbsp;
nun who was living in a convent in northern&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:31.200
Spain where men were strictly forbidden&nbsp;
from entering. But to Isabella’s dismay,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:36.240
she got pregnant one day. The church, which was&nbsp;
run by men, wanted to do nothing with sister&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:42.720
Isabella and disregarded her completely. So,&nbsp;
she and the nuns came together and protested.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:47.440
This triggered the women all around the world&nbsp;
who had been suppressing their anger until then.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:53.840
In 1954, Women United Rally came to the streets&nbsp;
of Washington DC. The men in power tried to calm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:58.480
them by saying that the scientists are still&nbsp;
trying to understand how this phenomenon can be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:05.920
possible. But the protests didn’t stop there. 
Women had had just enough of being called liars.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:10.320
The working women stopped going to their jobs&nbsp;
while housewives stopped looking after their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:16.240
families. They joined hands and rallied in&nbsp;
the streets. A clip from 1955 shows us that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:21.840
Helen Duval’s husband had come looking for her&nbsp;
wanting to take her back as his wife. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:26.720
Helen had come to a realization by then; she&nbsp;
didn’t need him for anything in her life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:35.200
Soon, women all over the world realized that the&nbsp;
men’s primary job was to help them procreate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:40.560
and without that, they are of no use. As the&nbsp;
number of fatherless pregnancies went up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:45.440
the number of sexual pregnancies went down&nbsp;
rapidly. Science finally came up with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:50.960
reasoning for the asexual pregnancies that were&nbsp;
so wildly debated. It turned out that women had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:55.920
evolved into asexual beings with time. Meaning&nbsp;
that their eggs could create all the genetic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.920 --> 00:05:01.760
materials that are required for childbirth. The&nbsp;
process of reproduction is called Parthenogenesis.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:07.280
As time passed, babies reproduced sexually&nbsp;
became rarer. When scientists looked into it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:12.240
they found out that eggs in women’s bodies&nbsp;
had stopped receiving sperm. Even if sperm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:17.680
was injected into the egg, it died instantly&nbsp;
making sexual reproduction impossible.
&nbsp;

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:21.760
In addition, because of the lack of y&nbsp;
chromosomes, every child that was born&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:28.400
as a result of parthenogenesis was a woman. Now,&nbsp;
the male species was on the verge of extinction.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:37.760
In 1965, Eleanor Hamilton became the first woman&nbsp;
American president in history. As time passed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:43.440
the power dynamic shifted and more women started&nbsp;
being seen in powerful positions. Things started&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.000
to change when the government introduced the&nbsp;
“worker replacement program” according to which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:53.760
every man who holds a powerful position in any&nbsp;
institution had to be reevaluated to see if they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:58.720
are actually fitted for the job or they got it&nbsp;
because of their male privileges. Eleanor called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:08.960
it the weeding out technique. Because of the&nbsp;
law, hundreds of men started to lose their jobs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:14.560
and go homeless. The agitated men all moved to&nbsp;
the woods in the countryside waiting for women&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:21.120
to realize their mistakes. But by the mid 1970s,&nbsp;
it was clear that women do not actually need men&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:26.880
to survive in any aspect of their lives. 
Some men began to return to society and take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:32.640
mediocre jobs while others stayed on their&nbsp;
ground and started protesting. The leader of men,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:38.800
Darius Smith claimed that their organization wants&nbsp;
respect and position back because women have done&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:45.600
enough injustice. By 1975, women represented over&nbsp;
three-quarters of the population of the earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:51.360
Because of this, all women’s menstrual cycles&nbsp;
began to synchronize and a new phenomenon called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:59.200
menstrual synchronization was discovered. Soon,&nbsp;
the world was united into one and governed by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:03.840
an international organization called the&nbsp;
world’s council. The government overthrew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:09.280
several military projects because they weren’t&nbsp;
needed anymore after world peace was established.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:14.160
They also stopped funding NASA and focused&nbsp;
on building a cleaner and safer environment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:19.600
on earth by building electric cars. To provide&nbsp;
men with proper accommodation, the government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:25.520
created sanctuaries all around the world and asked&nbsp;
all the male population to move there. Men were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:31.680
provided proper nutritious food, shelters, and&nbsp;
entertainment in the sanctuaries and were asked to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:37.360
confine themselves in those particular areas. 
At first, the men protested the idea but didn’t do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:42.480
much when the sanctuaries were established and&nbsp;
they started living a quality life. At present,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:47.840
Darius Smith still claims that the men are only&nbsp;
planning their attack in the sanctuaries and have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:53.280
not accepted the idea at all. When technology&nbsp;
develops people start to research the cause&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:58.240
of asexual reproduction being possible. While&nbsp;
science declares it as evolution, some people&nbsp;&nbsp;

