baby was born which means that the comet had&nbsp;
something to do with the transformation. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:18.960
the theory is claimed to be only a rumor. 
Currently, thirty seven year old Andrew is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:23.840
youngest man on the earth. He works as a house&nbsp;
help for a family that consists of only women.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:29.120
The couple, Iris Balashev and Terra Ganger&nbsp;
have appointed him to help them take care of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:33.920
their daughters. Andrew says that he doesn’t feel&nbsp;
