00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:50.160
She also believes that his influence will be&nbsp;
good on her children and grandchildren because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:55.120
they will be able to live as the last few&nbsp;
women who have male influence in their lives.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.120 --> 00:09:03.040
Andrew’s other boss Terra isn’t very fond of him&nbsp;
