&nbsp;

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:12.400
When the children go to the field for their&nbsp;
football match, they bring Andrew with them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:18.560
for help but he is only allowed to stay on the&nbsp;
sidelines. While waiting, Andrew meets two men,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:24.240
who are of course older than him. They, too, are&nbsp;
