00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:36.080
The guys quietly follow her orders and separate.&nbsp;
One day while Terra and Iris are in an interview&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:41.120
telling people what it is like living with Andrew,&nbsp;
Iris says that she likes Andrew a lot. As the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:47.120
