that her parenting partner is attracted to Andrew.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:52.080
She asks the interviewer to cut the cameras&nbsp;
and storms off. When Iris is alone with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:57.360
interviewer in the kitchen she admits that she and&nbsp;
