00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:14.160
remotely sexual between a man and a woman. 
Terra witnesses this and sends the kids back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:18.560
into the house. Meanwhile, the leader&nbsp;
of the men’s extremist group, Darius&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:24.240
comes forward with his claims that they are being&nbsp;
fed food mixed with estrogen so their sexual urges&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:29.600
would be suppressed. The men from the sanctuary go&nbsp;
on a hunger strike but it only lasts for a day and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:34.640
a half. Darius pretends that they have decided&nbsp;
to keep eating the food so no one forgets what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:39.920
the men going through in the sanctuaries. After&nbsp;
being found having an affair with his employer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:44.240
Andrew’s work permit is revoked and he&nbsp;
is sent to a sanctuary in Vancouver.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:52.240
He lives there for a while but his mind and heart&nbsp;
are back at the house. He cannot get Iris out of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:57.440
his head even for a second. The other men living&nbsp;
with him have given up because they do not have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:03.040
any reason to want to go back to society but&nbsp;
Andrew is always thinking of a way to escape. 
&nbsp;

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:08.720
He somehow manages to send Iris a letter and&nbsp;
