00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:39.040
With a lot of scientific research, Iris is&nbsp;
able to become pregnant with Andrew’s child.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:45.040
Scientists disguised the XY chromosomes in&nbsp;
the sperm to make it seem like XX and hence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:50.400
Iris gets pregnant. The movie ends as Andrew says&nbsp;
that he doesn’t want the child to be a girl and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:54.880
Iris looks at him in disappointment. 
